        <p>
            Words of Plainness is a ministry, not a business. We do not sell advertising,
            we do not run tracking networks, we do not share your information with
            marketers, and we do not monetize your attention. The only reason we collect
            information at all is to make the website work and to answer the people who
            write to us or subscribe to our newsletter.
        </p>
